---

<figure class="chat-mock" aria-label="Illustrative Claude Desktop conversation">
    <figcaption>
        <span class="dots" aria-hidden="true">
            <i></i>
            <i></i>
            <i></i>
        </span>
        Claude Desktop
    </figcaption>
    <div class="thread">
        <p class="msg user">
            <small>You</small>
            Why did our DigitalOcean bill jump this week?
        </p>
        <p class="msg tool">
            <small>Tool call · Kestra MCP</small>
            Evaluate DigitalOcean Bill
            <br />
            <code>do_spend_summary → new execution</code>
        </p>
        <p class="msg result">
            <small>Result from the flow</small>
            Spend rose day over day, driven by new droplets in one region. That
            looks like a deployment change, not normal variation, so it’s worth
            confirming with the team that launched them.
        </p>
    </div>
</figure>

<style lang="scss">
    .chat-mock {
        margin: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid #2e2e3c;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        background: #18181e;
        box-shadow: 0 30px 80px -24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }

    figcaption {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #2e2e3c;
        background: #1e1e26;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #adadbf;
    }

    .dots {
        display: inline-flex;
        gap: 0.375rem;

        i {
            width: 0.625rem;
            height: 0.625rem;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #2e2e3c;
        }
    }

    .thread {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.875rem;
        padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .msg {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        font-size: $font-size-sm;
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: #d6d6e0;

        small {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
            font-family: $font-family-monospace;
            font-size: 0.6875rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #9696a5;
        }

        code {
            padding: 0;
            background: none;
            font-family: $font-family-monospace;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #b9a6ff;
        }
    }

    .user {
        align-self: flex-end;
        max-width: 85%;
        background: #26262f;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .tool {
        border: 1px dashed rgba(152, 105, 247, 0.5);
        background: rgba(152, 105, 247, 0.08);
        color: #ffffff;

        small {
            color: #b9a6ff;
        }
    }

    .result {
        border-left: 2px solid #06f0b1;
        background: rgba(30, 135, 94, 0.12);
    }
</style>
